OL,3,GNEWSAInquiry after man dies in Luton
OL,4,Abungalow fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died at the scene of a
OL,7,Fbungalow fire in Luton.
OL,9,FBedfordshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,10,Fsaid crews were called to the property
OL,11,Fin Icknield Way, near the junction of
OL,12,FNewbold Road, at 08:28 GMT on Tuesday.
OL,14,FNeighbour Arshad Iqbal said residents
OL,15,F"tried their best", having banged on
OL,16,Fthe man's front door when they saw
OL,17,Fsmoke coming from his home.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
