OL,4,Abungalow fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice were also at the scene and a
OL,7,Ffire service spokesperson said
OL,8,Finquiries were ongoing to establish the
OL,9,Fcircumstances and the "most likely"
OL,10,Fcause of the blaze.
